{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923130/extras/db7629025fa0e8012660f81831fb3037.avif?t=1772848171\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923130/extras_big/db7629025fa0e8012660f81831fb3037.webp?t=1772848171 width=1560 height=1293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw bombs and charge ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this stage-clearing action game packed with respect for 80\u2019s arcades, rescue the lady imprisoned in the factory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero is a cute yet tough bipedal cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the nostalgic tones of the 1980s as you infiltrate a dangerous bomb factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage is filled with unique gimmicks that will test your judgment and action skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy four computer terminals with the bombs placed around the stage to disable the barrier \u2014 then deliver the finishing blow to the boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest assured \u2014 the controls and speed are tuned to 21st-century standards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a fresh bomb-throwing action experience that fuses retro visuals with modern gameplay.<br><br>Streaming and monetized videos are welcome. No permission required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923130/extras/235441daa41cddc5bf9ff18c89d80be2.avif?t=1772848171\" width=520 height=293 /></span>If directional input behaves incorrectly on some controllers, please enable <strong>Steam Input</strong> in the controller settings for this game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Clear EASY Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3923130/03733cb